<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">After all, they were caught bang to rights=
, after a year-long investigation by journalist Pablo Torre and his podcast=
, Pablo Torre Finds Out, which won a Pulitzer Prize for its work. The podca=
st unfurled its findings over several episodes and faced deep skepticism, i=
ncluding from Mark Cuban, Dallas Mavericks minority owner and Ballmer=E2=80=
=99s fellow billionaire. =E2=80=9CI=E2=80=99m on Team Ballmer,=E2=80=9D Cub=
an <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.QvkQtXiSzS=
INXrMyEJiuYjtHC-3-SaTJx866FVPWJ_smceASdVGEr1uGMn1M0vaHV7D8b3cXGzhYY4_StEyIm=
