PzzGRxfVR496dGz-sGqKb1chpGu0Q3apEI" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">ridiculous</a=
> and <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLM=
EmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEDDYr4PKvW3UhO3nXd1GhDwpqzTtCPsSN2FCMtzXQ=
gdfGt-5JxZFpZDYj-l2gmEyIDa5wkVIbf1_1EmJMT4mWnur2UOyTgi0TvuQlgp4Ziw3gZ_wCjme=
qGJtP_zWSJbzp51xYHxOf-VwNhZ1ukAbO3CWCLW7qfsbQeIAJVTQKvftBb3Rs52rE-Kf4J1XZgL=
61IfT8taK3KogO5Q9drVc8OfPVHnskh6Na5BjFGeypdoLWDTKOxQZ4gjwFtnU0j_C5Ww4PWLd9t=
KYfXhYWx1zMWlzqR1-1UjVQlAWYu20kWHKg/4ui/epM9dszhSn2jEmhms0MiXw/h30/h001.A4O=
TQdS8aXQVJb-k__LWvJPAnm4XMbVAgtYru19o9uw" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">spitefu=
l</a> New York Knicks owner James Dolan, who <a href=3D"https://ablink.edit=
orial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IR5YkOKOzj6JW_WrVIpC8D2E=
1CGuKa8hmUZZ5GSwabFYnSxpNbhPM9EAoZ3K2w50LHvGygltUtRrArj6IZI8Z-5j74nHx_T6xSx=
mxAOG3lM5AJEI6VQMqz5gTl9Pco8shHYSrfAauY9667t-m1B07Vd0Bdr31MREBhzA-mGVE1bTRj=
iCmY3eoF5VPAoPabrNKoNq0IxPbR4rlOSBuw_jmI_a0EqOrxSQE2WR9JrqWu2x0vkj6-E6Ivbpq=
is8HwIKw89Iv1UYe_J7lgRV-66syMtILfac7oNhprtucaYYOQG1rVDjMFGdQaU3yQk-X4IWxSNj=
UogWyFbXksiygX20wOYY/4ui/epM9dszhSn2jEmhms0MiXw/h31/h001.xcBAq9yPM8kk5zeLoj=
QfIZ8womjMIP1jbu35QikQkFs" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">faces a lawsuit</a> by=
 a former employee over discrimination in which it=E2=80=99s alleged that h=
e spied on the team=E2=80=99s own fans illegally =E2=80=93 this, too, <a hr=
ef=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.HT6_61rcAeQ71YMHfB=
Fwudh8nG4NaBrfCAiRj3N5vPX2ZLRUVgb4FWVEhQY-C4ljubktOmx7yf1lnyIeZtQn5gyUJT7im=
k5nLuxwdICvWHYDuZhO_GPHsbT9x-Ms5oukR1gdv7iiHSM6eI0p4ofZoAN93eClWQr180gkEP4w=
1DXOC7lBtBRja9ach9N9nP-LIfXEpAfMeoapmjANrvGjGtbimPQbcI86rI9ghqJEAF-sqRozTYN=
293vQKKeMj3740skdxX9y8d8lcrDXkc5VfH8Qh5l-8HpB_JC1ZPRIk3w4QT1GPFueusJa3oaVvj=
85HGzMHHQDiD95hucbasUnVeAsJ5xzt-hfndQza87jxH10gbhOPGMmdL61mJlbTy_-/4ui/epM9=
dszhSn2jEmhms0MiXw/h32/h001.B919l7OxrByroIph7lPJZ01Gpn1NS9xIG2hEYQDeSBU" st=
yle=3D"color: #0077B6;">had been reported by Torre</a>. It feels unlikely t=
hat Dolan will ever feel any effects from the accusations.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">And this is in addition to innumerable exa=
mples outside sports =E2=80=93 including a certain resident of the White Ho=
use, and a lot of his friends and allies.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Time will probably mark out the Clippers a=
nd City cases as outliers. But that, for now, is what makes them so notable=
, so newsworthy. People of power and means running into the consequences of=
 their own decadent and crooked decisions. A true novelty in our time.</p>
